Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:33.72,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't give up kakugo kimetano nara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't give up, if I'm determined{\i0}
