Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:57.55,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:02:01.72,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:02:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Roger Pirates are disbanded!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After reaching the last island, Laugh Tale,\Nthe Roger Pirates disbanded.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden, who returned to the Land of Wano,\Nlearned that Orochi is sitting as the Shogun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the way Orochi does things!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! Protect my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Sad News!\NThe Opening of the Great Pirate Era!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to attack Orochi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki, you don't have to be afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi will stop at nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel,\Nbut it is too dangerous to charge in with no plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave Kuri to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't understand complicated things,\Nbut I think this is what happened.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A fool took over the Land of Wano!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the help of a strong pirate,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a weak fool took advantage of the period of isolation\Nduring which no one would intervene...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and is trying to...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...turn this country into hell!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Be merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a beautiful country...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let him turn it into hell!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--H-Hey!\N--Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency!\NKozuki Oden is heading toward the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0} immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Orochi-{\i0}sama{\i1}! Please respond! Orochi-{\i0}sama{\i1}!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} has returned?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,--He's the true heir!\N--Will he become the Shogun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi's dominion will end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave, Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Shogun Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot enter without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun Orochi! Please evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden invaded the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute! Oden-{\i1}sa{\i0}... O-Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Think twice!\NIf you cut me up, Kaido won't just take it lying down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Think what'll happen to this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,After I slice you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I forgot... he's...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's crazy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it glass?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be scared, Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust my Barrier-Barrier technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:46.17,On Top,,0,0,0,,KUROZUMI SEMIMARU - A BIWA PLAYING PRIEST
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In theory,\Nmy barriers won't allow anyone to come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your strength means nothing, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were a pirate,\NI'm sure you're really familiar with...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...the superhuman powers of the Devil Fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:12.44,DefaultLow,,0,0,0,,KUROZUMI HIGURASHI - AN OLD WOMAN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a power-user!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NPeople in this country call them magic-users...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden, if anger and violence were the answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the Daimyos from other regions \Nwould already have done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:10:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard, for whatever reason,\Nmy father named you as a proxy Shogun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...until my return!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, yield the throne to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to become such a big shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can make it a somewhat \Nbetter country than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not what your father, Sukiyaki, said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you back, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the Daimyos and all the \Nother fools believed was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They believed a lie from this old woman\Nwho transformed herself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,with the Clone-Clone Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole country believed it\Nand let me have the Shogun's post!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't have to switch positions with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's no way to know\Nwhat the real Sukiyaki was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to my father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he really die of an illness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:50.10,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That day, upon the crowd that was looking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:52.73,Italics,,0,0,0,,up at the castle cheering for \Nthe return of the Kozuki Clan,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}poisoned arrows rained down from nowhere.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:12:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two people were wounded\Nand lost their sight after a bout of bloody vomit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The other townspeople\Nwho took shelter in the disarray...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...saw a big dragon\Nup in the darkened sky of the capital!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He grew up as a wild man,\Nbut he became the Daimyo of Kuri and went out to sea,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and matched up evenly with\Nthe world's greatest pirates...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then, he returned home\Nhaving become a lot stronger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The invincible Kozuki Oden!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NOden-{\i1}sama{\i0} will save this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}! We were waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was expected to become a savior for the people\Nwho suffered the power of evil...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A few hours later, Kozuki Oden...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...stripped himself down\Nin front of the Shogun Orochi's castle...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and acted like a fool.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, radish, {\i0}ganmo{\i1}!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chikuwa{\i1} and eggs!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One, two, three, go ahead and eat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden{\i1} wouldn't be {\i0}oden{\i1}...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...if it wasn't boiled!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.87,0:14:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Orochi and Kaido's subordinates \Nlaughed at him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Having groveled in the dirt and earned\Na small amount of money, the big man went home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:44.15,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Land of Wano's true \Nheir, Kozuki Oden's return
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:47.65,Italics,,0,0,0,,was the nation's last hope, so to speak.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But people were completely let down\Nand deeply disappointed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And eventually, they even became angry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kuri's silly lord, Kozuki Oden!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The snake's stare petrified him with terror!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you laugh, you lose! Here we go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Konbu{\i1}, important!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Konbu{\i1} is important!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The essential factor for \Nthe taste is the stock!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden{\i1} wouldn't be {\i0}oden{\i1}...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...if it wasn't boiled!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden showed up in the capital once a week,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and clowned around in front of the castle\Nto earn a small amount of money.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even on rainy days.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or windy days.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or snowy days.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are begging you, Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell us the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you and Orochi talk about?!\NWhy are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the people of Kuri who believed in you all this time\Nfinally gave up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I dance naked and get paid every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Word of his strange behavior in the capital\Ntraveled to Kuri, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Daikon{\i1}, {\i0}ganmo{\i1}, {\i0}chikuwa{\i1} and eggs!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Konnyaku{\i1}, {\i0}chikuwabu{\i1}, {\i0}hanpen{\i1}, potatoes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, don't forget {\i0}shirataki{\i1} noodles, too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a man like him! Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you become Orochi's dog,\Ncut your belly like a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Konbu{\i1}, important! Life, important!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The essential factor for \Nthe taste is the stock!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A year later...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun's messenger brought this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Inherited will...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People's dreams... The tide of the times...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as people seek the answer of freedom,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}these things will never cease to be!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you say that you're gonna die soon,\NRoger?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what people of the World Government\Ncall me these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gold Roger."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is that your real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Gol D. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I meet people with "D" \Nin their names sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a crew member who has it.\NHis name is Teech.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "D" stand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, do you wanna know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a story from way back...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After receiving a foreign newspaper\Nfrom the Shogun Orochi, Oden...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...ran along the seacoast,\Ncried out loud, then, laughed...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and cried again...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get this over with quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you hide all \Nthe treasure you found?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, didn't you?!\NThat legendary treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My treasure?\NIf you want it, you can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything this \Nworld has to offer there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}24 years before the present day,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the world went wild over the execution of\Nthe King of the Pirates, Gold Roger,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and to get the enormous wealth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:24.70,Italics,,0,0,0,,and the great treasure of\Nthe One Piece he left behind,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:29.20,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}all sorts of people took to the sea.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was the beginning \Nof the Great Pirate Era.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You lived quite a life!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:21.46,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Orochi's nefarious plan is revealed!\N He uses any means necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:25.46,Italics,,0,0,0,,for his evildoing and Oden \Nfinally erupts in anger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To save the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden and the Akazaya members face\NKaido, their domination-plotting nemesis.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The legendary raid that will go down to\Nposterity is about to be launched!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.39,0:23:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Raid! Oden and the Akazaya Nine!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
